{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Eliminate All Targets with Just a Few Bullets!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the core element of the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u203b Is this just another ricochet shooting game?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What sets this game apart is that <strong>the player creates the ricochet angles themselves</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can move and rotate reflective barriers to design your own ricochet paths.<br>By chaining these barriers together, you can create complex trajectories\u2014allowing you to wipe out multiple targets with a single bullet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748000/extras/aca1f0d29657e066fb2b121f7bc5b2d8.avif?t=1752328889\" width=800 height=451 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u203b So, is creating a lot of ricochet paths with one bullet always the right answer?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No! The map is filled with various environmental objects that can either <strong>help or hinder</strong> the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must <strong>strategically use or overcome</strong> these elements while carefully firing each bullet to destroy all targets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748000/extras/34c7047cfb0c4e02b0be179ec8d81f20.avif?t=1752328889\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u203b Won\u2019t this game cause fatigue for the player?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not at all!<br>The challenge of strategic planning is rewarded with <strong>visceral impact</strong>, satisfying action, and <strong>explosive visual effects</strong>\u2014delivering a rush of catharsis.<br>This is the true fun of the game!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3748000?t=1752328889","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3748000?t=1752328889","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748000/95a0838cf07851a6cd567c72ac736cdde910f111/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752328889","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748000/95a0838cf07851a6cd567c72ac736cdde910f111/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752328889","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Eliminate All Targets with Just a Few Bullets!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the core element of the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u203b Is this just another ricochet shooting game?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What sets this game apart is that <strong>the player creates the ricochet angles themselves</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can move and rotate reflective barriers to design your own ricochet paths.<br>By chaining these barriers together, you can create complex trajectories\u2014allowing you to wipe out multiple targets with a single bullet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748000/extras/aca1f0d29657e066fb2b121f7bc5b2d8.avif?t=1752328889\" width=800 height=451 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u203b So, is creating a lot of ricochet paths with one bullet always the right answer?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No! The map is filled with various environmental objects that can either <strong>help or hinder</strong> the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must <strong>strategically use or overcome</strong> these elements while carefully firing each bullet to destroy all targets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748000/extras/34c7047cfb0c4e02b0be179ec8d81f20.avif?t=1752328889\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u203b Won\u2019t this game cause fatigue for the player?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not at all!<br>The challenge of strategic planning is rewarded with <strong>visceral impact</strong>, satisfying action, and <strong>explosive visual effects</strong>\u2014delivering a rush of catharsis.<br>This is the true fun of the game!</p>","developers":["Creative Universe"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748000/f1e203751a4b08daf0179798ff153308144f83ac/header.jpg?t=1752328889","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3748000/1097580451/b1ab5a45d6b4977e03fcc9a2d98ea65971c7bceb/1751903833/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751904726","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3748000/1097580451/b1ab5a45d6b4977e03fcc9a2d98ea65971c7bceb/1751903833/dash_h264.mpd?t=1751904726","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3748000/1097580451/b1ab5a45d6b4977e03fcc9a2d98ea65971c7bceb/1751903833/hls_264_